sunnypilot extra model catalog (applied by scripts/setup_psa_torque_common.sh, sunny variant only).

The Models menu on the comma, and the model list on sunnylink, also show the openpilot.distill models
published on Hugging Face (cristianku/openpilot-distill-models, driving_models.json, written by
openpilot.distill helpers/publish_model.sh). The extra bundles are merged into the qcom catalog when it
is fetched (models/extra_catalog.py); ModelManager_ActiveJson keeps only the chestnut url, so sunnylink
reads the small models from the device cache, where the merged list is.
Made against sunnypilot master / nav-alpha 3ee0c7df9 (October 20, 2026).

